WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:01,070
Stop doing this

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,200
Give you time for a meal

3
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:04,360
Can't convince me

4
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:06,120
Pack up your things yourself

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:12,330
Xu Qingyao fell in love with a guy who drove a BMW and we left. I didn’t stop him.

6
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:14,060
I don't dare to tell you either

7
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,570
How dare he find someone else first?

8
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:25,660
This is because I think my son is not good enough for him. I have to go find his mother. Don’t, don’t, don’t. This is all divorced.

9
00:00:25,660 --> 00:00:31,340
What's the big deal if you come here again? It's also Lao Lin.

10
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:35,860
Just leave the house and get the guy's mother to calm down. They're already divorced.

11
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,260
What kind of trouble do you want to cause, Mom?

12
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:41,380
I really don’t want to have sex with him in the car, okay, okay?
